# Français (French) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Translation by cross6200 (MX Bikes community), made against 1.34.2;
# lines added since were drafted for 1.35 in the same style. Not yet reviewed
# line by line by a native speaker. Corrections are welcome: see README.md in
# the parent folder.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = pilote, bike = moto, lap = tour, sector = secteur, split = interm.,
#   gap = écart, PB = record perso, standings = Positions (the tab and HUD) /
#   classement (in prose), pits = stands,
#   penalty = pénalité, session = séance, practice = essais, qualify = qualif,
#   race = course, settings = réglages, hotkeys = raccourcis, rumble = vibrations,
#   notice = alerte, achievement = succès, crash = chute, web overlay = overlay web,
#   On/Off = Oui/Non, Default = Défaut.
